Exit Test Dedicated State And Close Connections
    [Documentation]  Exits Test Dedicated State if it is active and checks, whether BTS reaches onAir after.
    ...              Allows to perform optional sleep (waiting given time without doing anything) before exiting TDS.
    [Arguments]      ${sleep_time}=0s
    ${bts_type}=                                         hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                       connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    Create admin session with default alias              bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${bts_status}=                                       admin_info_model.get_bts_statuses
    ...                                                  connection=${connection}
    Run Keyword If                                       '${bts_status["proceduralState"]}'!='Test'
    ...                                                  Run Keywords
    ...                                                  Robot Log Warning
    ...                                    BTS procedural state is currently ${bts_status["proceduralState"]}, not Test.
    ...                                                  AND
    ...                                                  Return From Keyword

    Robot Log Step  Waiting ${sleep_time} before exiting Test Dedicated State...
    Sleep           ${sleep_time}
    ...             reason=Waiting before exiting TDS to maximize chance of catching TDS related Prontos.

    Allow X2 Link Alarms
    Create Selenium Session                         admin_connection=${connection}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    run keyword and ignore error                    webui.disable_test_dedicated_state

    Robot Log Result                                Test Dedicated State has been disabled

    Connections.Close Selenium Session

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                     12 min
    ...                                             10 sec
    ...                                             Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                     1 min
    ...                                             5 sec
    ...                                             Verify BTS states
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                             status=OnAir

    Disallow X2 Link Alarms

    [Teardown]                                      Connections.Close Selenium Session

